    "description": "The Telecom SIM Portability API enables users to initiate the portability process for their mobile SIM cards seamlessly. This endpoint allows telecom service providers and consumers to submit requests for transferring SIM services from one network operator to another. Typical use cases involve customer service teams and end-users looking to switch carriers while retaining their phone numbers. The API streamlines the portability experience, ensuring quick and efficient handling of requests, thus enhancing customer satisfaction.",
